  "instance_name": "immigration_status_assumptions",
  "label": "Immigration Status Assumptions",
  "description": "The implicit belief that immigration status is a defining characteristic of a person's worth or moral standing. The meme relies on this assumption by contrasting 'illegals' with 'actual citizens,' which is a common stereotype used in anti-immigrant rhetoric. This stereotype is central to understanding the meme's message and its potential to incite prejudice.",
